flowchart TD
    Start([Start: convertNFAtoDFA]) --> Validate[Validate NFA Specification]
    Validate --> ValidCheck{Validation Passed?}
    ValidCheck -- No --> ReturnError[Return Failure & Error Messages]
    
    ValidCheck -- Yes --> InitQueue[Initialize Empty Queue Q_process and Sets]
    InitQueue --> CreateStartSubset[Start Subset S0 = {q0}]
    CreateStartSubset --> LabelStart[Assign Sequential Label 'A' to S0]
    LabelStart --> AddStartQueue[Enqueue 'A' into Q_process]
    AddStartQueue --> RecordStep1[Record Step 1: Type INITIALIZE]

    RecordStep1 --> QueueCheck{Is Q_process Empty?}
    
    QueueCheck -- No --> DequeueState[Dequeue currentLabel, get Subset S]
    DequeueState --> MarkProcessed[Add currentLabel to processedStates]

    MarkProcessed --> IsDeadState{Is S == Empty Set ∅?}
    IsDeadState -- Yes --> HandleDead[For all a in Σ: δ'(∅, a) = ∅]
    HandleDead --> QueueCheck

    IsDeadState -- No --> LoopSymbols[For each alphabet symbol a in Σ]
    LoopSymbols --> ComputeUnion[Compute U = ⋃ δ_NFA(q, a) for all q in S]
    ComputeUnion --> CanonicalSort[Sort and Deduplicate U to make Canonical Key]

    CanonicalSort --> CheckEmptyU{Is U Empty ∅?}
    CheckEmptyU -- Yes --> AssignTrap[targetLabel = '∅' Trap State]
    CheckEmptyU -- No --> ExistsCheck{Does Key exist in subsetToLabel?}

    ExistsCheck -- Yes --> AssignExisting[targetLabel = subsetToLabel(Key)]
    ExistsCheck -- No --> GenerateNewLabel[Generate Next Label e.g. B, C, D]
    GenerateNewLabel --> RegisterNewState[Add targetLabel to dfaStates & stateSubsets]
    RegisterNewState --> CheckAccepting{Does U contain any NFA Final State?}
    CheckAccepting -- Yes --> MarkDFAFinal[Add targetLabel to dfaFinalStates]
    CheckAccepting -- No --> EnqueueNew[Enqueue targetLabel into Q_process]
    MarkDFAFinal --> EnqueueNew
    EnqueueNew --> SetTargetLabel[targetLabel = Generated Label]

    AssignTrap --> RecordTrans[Set dfaTransitions(currentLabel, a) = targetLabel]
    AssignExisting --> RecordTrans
    SetTargetLabel --> RecordTrans

    RecordTrans --> SnapshotStep[Record ConversionStep with formula, union, and table snapshot]
    SnapshotStep --> MoreSymbols{More symbols in Σ?}
    MoreSymbols -- Yes --> LoopSymbols
    MoreSymbols -- No --> QueueCheck

    QueueCheck -- Yes --> FinalStep[Record Step: Type COMPLETE]
    FinalStep --> ReturnDFA([Return DFA Object & Complete Steps History])
